<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5040] ML examples</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5040</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve reviewed examples for ML module and found some issues:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. There&apos;s no description for examples at beginning of code (as we&apos;ve for other java examples)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2. TracerExample opens the empty HTML page (seems JS error)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3. Example isn&apos;t a test and shouldn&apos;t have asserts. Correctness of example results is responsibility of tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4. Some local API calls used without running Ignite nodes would be better to provide as part of remote jobs sent to the cluster&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13065507">IGNITE-5040</key>
            <summary>ML examples</summary>
